# --- Terraform (nested anywhere under sources/) ---
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.json
**/override.tf
**/override.tf.json
**/*_override.tf
**/*_override.tf.json
**/.terraformrc
**/terraform.rc

# --- Harvest output and caches (never committed; rebuilt by the script) ---
**/out/
**/.cache/

# --- PowerShell / Pester ---
TestResults/
*.trx
coverage.xml

# --- Editors / OS ---
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Local secrets ---
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key*.stackdump
